{"about_the_game":"Waffles' Cranked Stories is a selection of mini-games set in the same universe as Inspector Waffles, originally released exclusively on the Playdate console. Follow the adventures of Chance and Spike and discover new stories that expand on the previous ones!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spike II: The Great Emu War (2023)</h2><br>He is back.<br><br>The emus are at the gates of CatTown. The cat army is overwhelmed by the number of feathered soldiers, the felines will soon become... an endangered species.<br><br>General Mittens has no other choice: he must call the legendary Spike to the rescue.<br><br>Equipped with your minigun, try to survive the horde of emus who will do their best to catch you. As General Mittens used to say: &quot;You are our last hope, Spike!&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018520/extras/ac252afca2aad3793b9363f3cb7dfdb2.poster.avif?t=1766490342\" width=400 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018520/extras/ac252afca2aad3793b9363f3cb7dfdb2.webm?t=1766490342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018520/extras/ac252afca2aad3793b9363f3cb7dfdb2.mp4?t=1766490342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chance's Lucky Escape (2025)</h2><br>Chance, the luckiest dog in the world, is called into action by the evil genius, Snowball.<br><br>But on the way, to his misfortune, a tire on his car bursts. Stopped in the middle of the fast lane, pursued by the dog-sniffing officer Jane, will Chance be lucky enough to escape from this fate?<br><br>Inspired by 80s cartoons and absurdist comedy films, play as Chance in this point-and-click adventure game where luck plays a central role.<br><br>Art by Julia Minamata (The Crimson Diamond).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018520/extras/fa9e4fb9524fff18ac789e7fdb8e78c1.gif?t=1766490342\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018520/extras/fa9e4fb9524fff18ac789e7fdb8e78c1.poster.avif?t=1766490342\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018520?t=1766490342","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018520?t=1766490342","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018520/1b14efad3d57dce2c8c1cccd8fc9d437cad00b3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766490342","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018520/1b14efad3d57dce2c8c1cccd8fc9d437cad00b3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766490342","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Waffles' Cranked Stories is a selection of mini-games set in the same universe as Inspector Waffles, originally released exclusively on the Playdate console. Follow the adventures of Chance and Spike and discover new stories that expand on the previous ones!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spike II: The Great Emu War (2023)</h2><br>He is back.<br><br>The emus are at the gates of CatTown. The cat army is overwhelmed by the number of feathered soldiers, the felines will soon become... an endangered species.<br><br>General Mittens has no other choice: he must call the legendary Spike to the rescue.<br><br>Equipped with your minigun, try to survive the horde of emus who will do their best to catch you. As General Mittens used to say: &quot;You are our last hope, Spike!&quot;